<title>UK: Bass falls as BZW moves from buy to hold.</title>
<headline>Bass falls as BZW moves from buy to hold.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in brewer-to-hotels group Bass Plc were 14p lower at 864p after BZW changed its stance on the stock from a buy to a hold on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have moved the stock from a buy to a hold as of today. We have seen the shares hit our price target of 880p,&quot; said BZW analyst Charles Winston.</p>
<p>Bass's share price has recently risen steeply and analysts said it was due for a slight correction once the stockmarket eased. Since the New Year started the shares have risen from 810p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6437</p>
